<mxCell id="scope" value="Selected financial KYC members. ID photo references live in CollaboratorProfile.socialLinksJson, bank details in its fields. Legacy reviewKyc allows Shop/Admin/Manager and delegates to reviewKolApplication; the shared UI uses Admin-only routes. Upload, DTO, social channel and Shop-onboarding details: FR03_CODE_ANALYSIS.md." style="text;html=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;spacing=0;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="2150" width="2500" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>